    "sections": {
        "description": "XHub Blog is a lightweight, fast-loading WordPress blog theme designed for bloggers, content creators, and digital magazines. Built as a child theme of X Hub, it offers a clean minimal design with modern grid and list post layouts, a responsive mobile menu, featured post carousel, and full customizer support. Perfect for personal blogs, news portals, lifestyle magazines, and niche content sites. SEO-friendly, accessibility-ready, and optimized for Core Web Vitals performance."
